2026-10-31T18:48:46.5712170Z [36;1m# This step installs uutils, which replaces coreutils in PATH, so the[0m
2026-10-31T18:48:46.5712586Z [36;1m# very next command runs uutils' ln. uutils 0.12.0-r0 rewrote the -f[0m
