2026-10-31T18:49:29.1055957Z [36;1m[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1056199Z [36;1m# This step used to `exit 1` the moment any build_push leg was not[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1056576Z [36;1m# success/skipped. `needs.build_push.result` is the aggregate of the[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1056973Z [36;1m# whole platform matrix, so one arch failing aborted the manifest —[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1057340Z [36;1m# and with it every stage that depends on this flavor, including[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1057697Z [36;1m# flavors that declare only the arch that DID build. On 2026-08-14[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1058249Z [36;1m# that turned three `sudo podman login` faults on arm64 runners into[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1058613Z [36;1m# 16 red cells across sailfin/marlin/flounder/gurnard, 14 of which[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1058985Z [36;1m# never produced a job at all (tuna-os/tunaOS#1729).[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1059236Z [36;1m#[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1059474Z [36;1m# The real precondition for building a manifest is "at least one[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1059823Z [36;1m# platform produced a digest", which is asserted from the digest[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1060184Z [36;1m# artifacts in `Require at least one platform` below — evidence of[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1060572Z [36;1m# what was actually pushed, not an aggregate job result. Completeness[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1060950Z [36;1m# is still enforced, just later and where it belongs: `Check Platform[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1061316Z [36;1m# Completeness` sets all_platforms_built=false and the promote job[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1061674Z [36;1m# leaves the bare :<flavor> tag at its last good version. A partial[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1062049Z [36;1m# build can therefore reach :<flavor>-candidate, and can never reach[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1062339Z [36;1m# :<flavor>.[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1062859Z [36;1mif echo "$JOBS" | jq -e 'to_entries[] | select(.value.result != "success" and .value.result != "skipped")' >/dev/null; then[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1063664Z [36;1m  echo "::warning::Not every upstream job succeeded; continuing with whatever platforms published. The bare tag will not be promoted unless all declared platforms are present."[0m
2026-10-31T18:49:29.1064221Z [36;1mfi[0m
